    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138785333255
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> successful hits, Bastet creates
      a Blessed Zone for <color=#C58CFF>{1}</color>s, increasing allies' SPD by <color=#42D9FF>{2}</color>%
      and HP by <color=#63E36F>{3}</color>% within the area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138785333256
    m_Localized: Gain 1 Forest Arrow whenever a skill is used. Upon reaching <color=#94FF40>{0}</color>
      arrows, they are fired automatically, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}</color>%
      ATK to the nearest enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138785333257
    m_Localized: Starts with <color=#FFD84A>{0}</color>% CRIT Rate. Each CRIT grants
      an additional <color=#94FF40>{1}</color>% for <color=#C58CFF>{2}</color>s,
      stacking up to <color=#94FF40>{3}</color> times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138785333258
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> Basic Attacks, Ophelia enters Rising
      Tide for <color=#C58CFF>{1}</color>s, increasing SPD by <color=#42D9FF>{2}</color>%
      and Final DMG by <color=#FF8A3D>{3}</color>%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527552
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> skill hits, Hatshepsut enters Desert
      Dominion for <color=#C58CFF>{1}</color>s, increasing Skill DMG by <color=#FF8A3D>{2}</color>%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527553
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> skill hits, Brandon-Lowen enters
      Fire Soul for <color=#C58CFF>{1}</color>s, increasing Skill DMG by <color=#FF8A3D>{2}</color>%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527554
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> Basic Attacks, Robert enters Rapid
      Fire for <color=#C58CFF>{1}</color>s, increasing SPD by <color=#42D9FF>{2}</color>%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527555
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> Basic Attacks, Edward enters Gale
      Fury for <color=#C58CFF>{1}</color>s, increasing ATK by <color=#FF8A3D>{2}</color>%
      and CRIT Rate by <color=#FFD84A>{3}</color>%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527556
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> skill damage or healing instances,
      Amelia enters Water Dance for <color=#C58CFF>{1}</color>s, increasing Skill
      DMG by <color=#FF8A3D>{2}</color>% and Healing Effect by <color=#63E36F>{3}</color>%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527557
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> Basic Attacks, Jerolur activates
      Holy Sword for <color=#C58CFF>{1}</color>s, increasing SPD by <color=#42D9FF>{2}</color>%
      and CRIT Rate by <color=#FFD84A>{3}</color>%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527558
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> attacks or skills hit a target,
      Riddle activates Royal Authority for <color=#C58CFF>{1}</color>s, increasing
      ATK by <color=#FF8A3D>{2}</color>% for himself and nearby allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527559
    m_Localized: Gain 1 Frost Armor stack every <color=#94FF40>{0}</color>s. Each
      stack increases DEF by <color=#6FA8FF>{1}</color>% and reflects damage equal
      to <color=#FF8A3D>{2}</color>% ATK. Upon reaching <color=#94FF40>{3}</color>
      stacks, gain a shield equal to <color=#94FF40>{4}</color>% Max HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527560
    m_Localized: Each attack grants 1 Water Note, while casting the Ultimate grants
      <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> notes. Each note increases Skill DMG by <color=#FF8A3D>{1}</color>%.
      At <color=#94FF40>{2}</color> notes, activates Resonance for <color=#C58CFF>{3}</color>s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721856
    m_Localized: Bastet unleashes <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> assassination waves,
      each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}</color>% ATK to up to <color=#94FF40>{2}</color>
      enemies. When an enemy is defeated, immediately unleashes 1 additional wave
      across the entire battlefield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721857
    m_Localized: Summons the Ancient Forest for <color=#C58CFF>{0}</color>s, creating
      <color=#94FF40>{1}</color> waves of wooden spikes. Each wave deals <color=#FF8A3D>{2}</color>%
      ATK as Wood DMG and automatically switches targets when an enemy is defeated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721858
    m_Localized: Emily dashes through the enemy formation and slashes <color=#94FF40>{0}</color>
      times, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}</color>% ATK. After casting, increases
      CRIT Rate by <color=#FFD84A>{2}</color>% for <color=#C58CFF>{3}</color>s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721859
    m_Localized: Fires <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> Moon Waves in a fan shape that
      pierce through targets, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}</color>% ATK. Enemies
      within overlapping areas can be hit multiple times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721860
    m_Localized: Summons <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> sand meteors at the area with
      the highest concentration of enemies, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}</color>%
      ATK to all enemies within the area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721861
    m_Localized: Unleashes a stream of blazing light for <color=#C58CFF>{0}</color>s,
      dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}</color>% ATK every <color=#94FF40>{2}</color>s to
      all enemies along a straight line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721862
    m_Localized: Unleashes a cone-shaped barrage for <color=#C58CFF>{0}</color>s
      with <color=#94FF40>{1}</color> hits, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{2}</color>%
      ATK to enemies within the firing area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721863
    m_Localized: Creates a zigzagging tornado that tears across the battlefield,
      dealing <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> hits. Each hit deals <color=#FF8A3D>{1}</color>%
      ATK, knocks enemies back, and stuns them for <color=#C58CFF>{2}</color>s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721864
    m_Localized: Creates a tidal zone for <color=#C58CFF>{0}</color>s, dealing <color=#94FF40>{1}</color>
      hits. Each hit deals <color=#FF8A3D>{2}</color>% ATK. When the zone ends, it
      explodes and deals an additional <color=#FF8A3D>{3}</color>% ATK.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721865
    m_Localized: Summons <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> Holy Swords for <color=#C58CFF>{1}</color>s.
      Each Basic Attack launches an additional sword, dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{2}</color>%
      ATK to targets in front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721866
    m_Localized: Creates a Royal Domain for <color=#C58CFF>{0}</color>s. Allies within
      the area gain <color=#FF8A3D>{1}</color>% ATK and <color=#42D9FF>{2}</color>%
      SPD, while enemies lose <color=#6FA8FF>{3}</color>% DEF.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721867
    m_Localized: Creates an ice rift that deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}</color>% ATK plus
      <color=#FF8A3D>{1}</color>% Max HP as damage to up to <color=#94FF40>{2}</color>
      targets and Freezes them for <color=#C58CFF>{3}</color>s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721868
    m_Localized: Creates <color=#94FF40>{0}</color> waves, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}</color>%
      MATK. Then detonates, dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{2}</color>% MATK and slowing
      enemies by <color=#94FF40>{3}</color>% for <color=#C58CFF>{4}</color>s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
