  - m_Id: 6481381023334400
    m_Localized: Summon {0} Times
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985847681024
    m_Localized: Yo, rookie! I'm Kata, the most seasoned captain on these seas. Ready
      to set sail for the Demon King's Tower?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041152
    m_Localized: (Skip) Let's get moving! No time to slack off, rookie!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041153
    m_Localized: See that? Your crew fights automatically. Your job is to lead them,
      not swing a sword!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041154
    m_Localized: Let them warm up first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041155
    m_Localized: Tap here to choose your main fighter! A great captain always knows
      who to send into battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041156
    m_Localized: Here's an old captain's secret! Switch to another hero to unleash
      a devastating Ultimate. Let's go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041157
    m_Localized: Busy? Turn on Auto Battle. Your crew will keep fighting even while
      you're off making a cup of tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041158
    m_Localized: It's okay to take it easy, as long as your treasure keeps piling
      up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041159
    m_Localized: Turn on Auto Ultimate! Your Ultimate Skills will activate automatically
      at the perfect moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041160
    m_Localized: "Here's your compass! Complete quests to earn rewards\u2014the fastest
      way to know where to go next."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041161
    m_Localized: Follow your quests, and you'll never lose your way on the open sea,
      rookie!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041162
    m_Localized: "All done! Time to claim your rewards. Loot won't jump into your
      bag on its own\u2014you've got to grab it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235456
    m_Localized: Nice loot! Stash it safely in your ship's hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235457
    m_Localized: Time to recruit your crew! Head to the Summon Hall and recruit new
      heroes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235458
    m_Localized: The bigger your crew, the stronger your ship. Let's go, rookie!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235459
    m_Localized: "Choose the type of hero you want, then summon! Luck favors true
      sailors\u2014you might just pull a rare one!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235460
    m_Localized: Come on, test your luck! Big waves bring big catches!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235461
    m_Localized: "Whoa! Look who we pulled! A mighty warrior for your crew\u2014your
      luck is incredible!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235462
    m_Localized: A rare one! Don't let this treasure slip away!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235463
    m_Localized: We've got a new recruit, so let's find them a place on the ship!
      Tap the Heroes area to arrange your formation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235464
    m_Localized: A well-organized crew makes for smooth sailing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235465
    m_Localized: "Add the new recruit to your formation! Drag him into an empty slot\u2014if
      there's a space, fill it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235466
    m_Localized: Fill every slot, and watch your power soar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235467
    m_Localized: "That's a fine-looking formation, little captain! Venture deeper
      and put your new crew to the test\u2014Floor 2 awaits!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235468
    m_Localized: "Raise the sails and press onward\u2014the treasure lies ahead!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235469
    m_Localized: Want to become even stronger? Upgrade your team's stats here. A
      good ship needs regular maintenance!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235470
    m_Localized: Investing in strength is never a bad deal, rookie!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235471
    m_Localized: "Choose the stat you want to boost, then tap Upgrade! Attack, HP,
      anything goes\u2014build your crew however you like."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235472
    m_Localized: Give them a little more power. You can never be too strong!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235473
    m_Localized: Maintenance complete! Head back to the deck. Tap Exit to return
      to the battlefield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235474
    m_Localized: You're stronger now. Go show those monsters what you've got!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235475
    m_Localized: "Feel the difference? Your crew is crushing everything in their
      path\u2014that's what a hardworking captain can achieve!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429760
    m_Localized: Keep this up, and the top of the tower will be within reach!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429761
    m_Localized: "Great heroes need great weapons! Head to Weapon Summon\u2014our
      armory is about to overflow!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429762
    m_Localized: You can't take down giant monsters bare-handed. Let's get you some
      gear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429763
    m_Localized: "Choose a weapon type and summon! Swords, guns, magic staves\u2014we've
      got them all. Pick whatever suits you best!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429764
    m_Localized: Summon a few more while you're at it. You can never have too much
      good gear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429765
    m_Localized: Look at this one! Razor-sharp! Equip it on your hero and they'll
      become unstoppable!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429766
    m_Localized: It'd be a crime to let a weapon this good go unused!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429767
    m_Localized: You've got the gear, so equip it! Don't just leave it there to admire.
      Tap the Equipment area and arm your crew.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429768
    m_Localized: Equip your gear and watch your power double!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429769
    m_Localized: Select the weapon slot you want to fill! Every hero needs a weapon
      that suits them, so choose wisely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429770
    m_Localized: Don't let a great weapon gather dust in the ship's hold!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429771
    m_Localized: This is your inventory. Pick the best weapon and equip it! Watch
      those stats shoot through the roof!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429772
    m_Localized: Choose carefully. A good weapon can decide the entire battle!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429773
    m_Localized: "All equipped and bursting with power, little captain! I've taught
      you everything\u2014now you're free to conquer the seas!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429774
    m_Localized: The open sea awaits. Call me whenever you need help. Now raise the
      sails and gooo!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429775
    m_Localized: Holy Blade Pierce
