  - m_Id: 6527985889624064
    m_Localized: Summons phantom blades from spatial portals that rush toward enemies
      and slash repeatedly, dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK as Skill DMG
      with each hit. Then unleashes an X-shaped finishing slash, dealing an additional
      <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% </color> ATK as Skill DMG to enemies around the primary
      target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624065
    m_Localized: Summons holy swords that rain down upon an enemy area, dealing multiple
      waves of damage. Each holy sword deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK as Skill
      DMG to enemies within the affected area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624066
    m_Localized: Summons holy swords that rain down upon an enemy area, dealing multiple
      waves of damage. Each holy sword deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK as Skill
      DMG to enemies within the affected area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624067
    m_Localized: Creates a rotating ring of blades at the target location, continuously
      damaging enemies within the area. Each tick deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK as Skill DMG and may slow enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624068
    m_Localized: Summons phantom swords that rain down upon the target area, dealing
      multiple waves of damage. Each wave deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK as
      Skill DMG to enemies within the affected area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624069
    m_Localized: Unleashes a dark slash at the priority target, dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK as Skill DMG. Upon hitting an enemy, creates a small damage zone around
      the target that deals additional damage to nearby enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624070
    m_Localized: Creates a zone of spinning blades around the target, continuously
      damaging enemies within range. Each hit deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK
      as Skill DMG.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624071
    m_Localized: Creates a zone of continuous slashes around the caster, dealing
      multiple hits to all nearby enemies. Each hit deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK as Skill DMG.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624072
    m_Localized: Marks the target, then detonates the mark to deal <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK as Skill DMG. The primary target takes full damage, while nearby enemies
      take partial damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624073
    m_Localized: Creates a large damage zone in the area with the highest concentration
      of enemies, continuously damaging all enemies within it. Each tick deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK as Skill DMG.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624074
    m_Localized: Summons a firestorm in the target area, continuously calling down
      lightning upon enemies within range. Each lightning bolt deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK as Skill DMG.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624075
    m_Localized: Gains 1 Lightning Arrow stack whenever a skill is activated. Upon
      reaching the required number of stacks, the arrows automatically fire at the
      nearest enemy, with each arrow dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK as Skill
      DMG.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624076
    m_Localized: Fires multiple electric arrows forward, attacking enemies with several
      different firing patterns. Each arrow deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK
      as Skill DMG. Burn deals an additional <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% </color> ATK/MATK
      every <color=#C58CFF>{2} </color>s for <color=#94FF40>{3} </color> times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624077
    m_Localized: Summons a Flame Phoenix that flies straight forward, continuously
      attacking enemies along its path. Each attack deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK as Skill DMG.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624078
    m_Localized: Rapidly fires multiple arrows forward. Each arrow deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK as Skill DMG and can pierce through multiple enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818368
    m_Localized: Fires an ice arrow at an enemy, then chains to nearby targets. The
      arrow deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK as Skill DMG, with damage decreasing
      after each chain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818369
    m_Localized: Summons a Thunder Dragon that creates an electric vortex, attacking
      nearby enemies and dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK as Skill DMG with
      each hit. Enemies with low HP may be instantly defeated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818370
    m_Localized: Summons a lightning matrix in the target area, continuously calling
      down lightning upon enemies within it. Each lightning bolt deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK as Skill DMG. After the final hit, triggers an electric explosion and inflicts
      Electrified on enemies hit. Burn deals an additional <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% </color>
      ATK/MATK every <color=#C58CFF>{2} </color>s for <color=#94FF40>{3} </color>
      times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818371
    m_Localized: Creates an ice ring beneath enemies, then summons erupting ice pillars
      within the area, dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK as Skill DMG and slowing
      enemies hit. If the target is affected by Burn or Electrified, deals an additional
      <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% </color> ATK as Skill DMG.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818372
    m_Localized: Opens lava portals in the sky, continuously summoning meteors onto
      the battlefield. Each meteor deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK as Skill
      DMG to enemies within the blast area. Burn deals an additional <color=#FF8A3D>{1}%
      </color> ATK/MATK every <color=#C58CFF>{2} </color>s for <color=#94FF40>{3}
      </color> times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818373
    m_Localized: Creates a void black hole that pulls enemies toward its center and
      continuously deals damage. Each wave deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK
      as Skill DMG. When it ends, the black hole explodes, dealing an additional
      <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% </color> ATK as AoE Skill DMG.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818374
    m_Localized: Summons magical crystals that orbit the caster and continuously
      fire lasers across the battlefield. Enemies touched by the lasers take <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK as Skill DMG. While casting, the caster takes reduced damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
